/-! # Normalized word-image tensors of the identification Root8[20]- <-> Tenth[69]+ (record
r8f:R88-, e = -1)

The net field values of the packed tensors `wR8fR88nTHX` and `wR8fR88nTGX` (divided by `2 ^ 16`
and `2 ^ 17`), stored as compact literals and certified by one cross-sum check per column; the
parts evaluate no word image. -/

